      "versionNonce": 2142149992,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786567738033,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Where do we find Canoe-integrated rejections?\nBrandon pulls these from LeadConduit (does it catch Canoe ones though?)\nDoes Lead Intake receive No Contact dispos?\nDoes Lead Intake log anything in a db table?\nWhy does Revive Optimal Calculator overestimate available RU? Zip overlap?\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Where do we find Canoe-integrated rejections?\nBrandon pulls these from LeadConduit (does it catch Canoe ones though?)\nDoes Lead Intake receive No Contact dispos?\nDoes Lead Intake log anything in a db table?\nWhy does Revive Optimal Calculator overestimate available RU? Zip overlap?\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
